## Appendix: the commands

The commands behind the sections, in order, run from the directory the program was named from, with `DOC` set to this document's directory.

```sh
presk check ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk
presk dump ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk --stage elab
presk check ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk --summary
presk dump ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk --stage core
presk calibrate --precision ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk --entry LayerNorm{8}.apply --dim batch=3 --bits 128 --out $DOC/artifacts/envelope.json
presk check --precision $DOC/artifacts/envelope.json ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk --realize f32 --model all --sites 8 --measure
presk dump ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk --stage realize --plan @$DOC/artifacts/plan.json
PRESK_THREADS=10 presk plan ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk --entry LayerNorm{8}.apply --dim batch=3 --realize f32 --profile tests/data/x925-frozen.json --out $DOC/artifacts/plan.json
presk dump ../../tests/examples/layernorm/layernorm.psk --stage kernel --entry LayerNorm{8}.apply --dim batch=3 --plan @$DOC/artifacts/plan.json
```
